{"m275-1":{"skills":[],"hints":[],"solution":"","answer":null,"comments":[{"author":"Beibarys0404","votes":1,"level":0,"html":"<p>По теореме Микеля $ZDCY$-вписан $\\Rightarrow 180°-\\angle{BCA}=\\angle{DCY}=\\angle{WZV} \\Rightarrow AB=WV$</p>"}],"cid":1592},"m275-2":{"skills":[],"hints":[],"solution":"","answer":null,"comments":[{"author":"Mopsichek","votes":1,"level":0,"html":"<p>$f(69)f(69^2)f(69^3)f(69^4)f(69^5)$</p><p>$i)=f(69^6)(f(69^5)(f(69^4)f(69^3)=f(69^{22})f(69^{14})=f(69^{72})$</p><p>$ii)f(69^{16})f(69^4)f(69^2)f(69)=f(69^{34})f(69^2)f(69^4)=f(69^{72})f(69^4)$</p><p>$\\rightarrow f(69^4)=1.$ </p><p>Невозможно.</p>"},{"author":"pokpokben","votes":2,"level":1,"html":"<p>а почему $f(69^{18})*f(69^4)*f(69^5)=f(69^{72})?$</p>"},{"author":"Mopsichek","votes":1,"level":2,"html":"<p>потому что $f(69^5)*f(69^4)=f(69^{18})$, а $f(69^{18})^2=f(69^{72})$</p>"},{"author":"pokpokben","votes":2,"level":3,"html":"<p>а вы не упускаете тот факт, что $a \\ne b?$</p>"},{"author":"Mopsichek","votes":1,"level":4,"html":"<p>все, исправил, спасибо)</p>"},{"author":"Mopsichek","votes":1,"level":0,"html":"<p>Не знаю, правильное ли мое решение, но вот:</p><p>$f(a)f(b)f(c)=1)f(a^2b^2)f(c)=f(a^4b^4c^2)$</p><p>$2)f(b^2c^2)f(a)=f(a^2b^4c^4)$ so they are equal. $f(a^4b^4c^2)=f(a^2)f(b^2c)$ and $f(a^4b^2c^4)=f(bc^2)f(a^2)$ so $f(bc^2)=f(b^2c)$. Let’s take such $b,c$ that $b=p^2$ and $c=q^2$ then we get that: $f(q^2p^4)=f(q^4p^2) \\rightarrow f(p)=f(q)=m \\rightarrow f(p)f(q)=m^2=f(p^2q^2)=m \\rightarrow m=0,1.$ Противоречие.</p>"},{"author":"ComplexNumbers","votes":0,"level":0,"html":"<p><b>Ответ:нет</b></p><p>$c \\in S$</p><p>$c^m \\ne a, b$</p><p>$f(a)f(b)f(c^2)=f(a^2b^2)f(c^2)=f((abc)^4)$</p><p>$f((abc)^4)=f(a)f(ab^2c^2)$</p><p>$f((abc)^4)=f(b)f(a^2bc^2)$</p><p>$f(a^2b^2)^2f(c^2)^2=f(a^2b^2)f(a^6b^6c^8)$</p><p>$f(a^4b^4c^4)f(c^2)=f(a^6b^6c^8)$</p><p>$f(a^8b^8c^{12})=f(a^6b^6c^8)$</p><p>$f(a^3b^3c^3)f(c)=f(a^3b^3c^3)f(abc^3)$</p><p>$f(c)=f(abc^3)$</p><p>$f(a^4b^4c^2)=f((abc)^6)$</p><p>$f(abc)f(ab)=f(abc)f((abc)^2)$</p><p>$f(ab)=f(ab)f(c) \\rightarrow f(c)=1 \\rightarrow \\varnothing \\blacksquare$</p>"},{"author":"Baimukha123","votes":1,"level":0,"html":"<p>$f(a^2)f(b)f(b^2)=f(a^4b^2)f(b)=f(a^8b^8)=f(a^2b^4)f(a^2)=f(a)f(b^2)f(a^2)\\Longrightarrow f(a)=f(b)=x\\Longrightarrow x=f(a^2b^2)=f(a)f(b)=x^2\\Longrightarrow x=1ㅤ\\varnothing$</p>"}],"cid":1593},"m275-3":{"skills":[],"hints":[],"solution":"","answer":null,"comments":[],"cid":1594},"m275-4":{"skills":[],"hints":[],"solution":"","answer":null,"comments":[],"cid":1595},"m275-5":{"skills":[],"hints":[],"solution":"","answer":null,"comments":[],"cid":1596}}